    "layout": "GetRect reads only already-resolved m_rect when flag 0x100 is set. RequireCachedRect checks XML owner thread, installed layout and live frame without resolving anchors or changing geometry. All mutation/creation/destruction/resize guards remain.",
    "palette": "Native ShaderConstantsLockRange validates target, full index/count span, qualified 94-register maximum and advertised device cap before returning shadow storage. Count arithmetic is uint64_t. Three original normal/instanced/shadow palette writers use it before writes. Original signatures and Windows code paths are retained.",
    "regression": "Layout fixtures cover resolved/unresolved reads during drawing, unchanged unresolved output, owner-thread enforcement and rejected size/anchor/destruction/creation/resize operations. Native startup fixtures cover first/last register pointer spans, oversized and uint64-overflowing requests, rejected pixel ranges and unchanged storage.",
    "remaining": "M2 cache selects original CPU loading, but CShaderEffect::s_enableShaders still drives the GPU palette path in CM2SceneRender. Final execution rejects that unsupported range before writes. CPU rendering/material selection remains open; no device cap was raised or effect silently skipped."
  },
